+  "STORE_NOT_CENTRAL": "WHAT: The task store does not resolve to the canonical main-repo .tasks directory.\nWHY: Production has one store. Any other path is invisible to other tasks or contaminates the code repository.\nHOW: Remove the tasks_dir override, or set it to <main_repo_root>/.tasks.\nCONSEQUENCE: Task records can diverge. SMASH IT BACK TO CENTRAL."
